message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "scientific-computing-system"
# Keep `version` in lockstep with pyproject.toml [project].version and
# src/cds/_version.py. scripts/check_version_discipline.py and
# scripts/check_version_lockstep.py enforce this.
version: 2.2.2
authors:
  - name: "Furox-Art"
    email: "furkanarkn1451@gmail.com"
abstract: >-
  Pure-Python computational science system with zero runtime dependencies.
  Numerical linear algebra, ODE/PDE solvers, quadrature, statistics and
  Bayesian conjugate analysis, Monte Carlo, signal processing, wavelets, quantum
  circuit simulation, symbolic modeling, uncertainty propagation, local and
  global sensitivity analysis, identifiability analysis, scientific validation,
  conservative assumption-gated causal estimation, SI dimensional analysis,
  approval-gated workflow orchestration, reproducibility provenance, and
  streaming scientific data I/O, with optional scientific backends.
license: MIT
